OL,3,GNEWSASix charged over theft of
OL,4,Ahigh-value Pokemon cards
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix men have been charged in connection
OL,7,Fwith the theft of high-value Pokemon
OL,8,Fcards from a warehouse in
OL,9,FNottinghamshire.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said on 17
OL,12,FDecember a group gained entry to a
OL,13,Fpremises on Aurillac Way in Retford,
OL,14,Fand stole 26 boxes of collectable
OL,15,Fcards.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
